{"1266470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Real VR Fishing", "steam_appid": 1266470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5105730, 4771320, 4486630, 3158890, 3158920, 3158900, 3158910, 3524450, 3524460, 3524470, 4035670, 4035680, 4035690, 4035700, 4164750], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Most Relaxing Fishing Trip in VR — Real VR Fishing</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast your line across meticulously recreated real-world landscapes. 40 maps and 150+ species in the base game expand to 100+ fishing spots and 300+ species with DLC. Whether you're a first-timer or a seasoned angler, enjoy at your own pace in a calm, unhurried world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1266470/extras/fd964218692fc59ffe2ab831bbc0e8af.poster.avif?t=1787747708\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1266470/extras/fd964218692fc59ffe2ab831bbc0e8af.webm?t=1787747708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1266470/extras/fd964218692fc59ffe2ab831bbc0e8af.mp4?t=1787747708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cast, Wait, Feel the Bite</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From casting to reeling, every action delivers lifelike resistance. Keep it easy in Normal Mode, or test your skills in Expert Mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1266470/extras/11524a260d95086e525411ff9bc55332.poster.avif?t=1787747708\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1266470/extras/11524a260d95086e525411ff9bc55332.webm?t=1787747708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1266470/extras/11524a260d95086e525411ff9bc55332.mp4?t=1787747708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo, or Up to 4 Players Together</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share the same fishing spot with friends, chat in real time, and enjoy the catch together. Real VR Fishing is more than a game, it's a place to unwind together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1266470/extras/8ee1ce9ab4ef13bc58a67fda718ee31c.poster.avif?t=1787747708\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1266470/extras/8ee1ce9ab4ef13bc58a67fda718ee31c.webm?t=1787747708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1266470/extras/8ee1ce9ab4ef13bc58a67fda718ee31c.mp4?t=1787747708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect, Progress, Customize</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up, release rare fish, and build out your avatar and your own personal aquarium.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show your flair by changing up your avatar with our many costume packs. Proudly display your catches in your personal aquarium, and add a touch of beauty with rocks, greenery and trophies from events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1266470/extras/a51cf74926bb2a87519ddd482b675dcb.poster.avif?t=1787747708\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1266470/extras/a51cf74926bb2a87519ddd482b675dcb.webm?t=1787747708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1266470/extras/a51cf74926bb2a87519ddd482b675dcb.mp4?t=1787747708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A New Adventure: Picnic Festa DLC</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 7 picnic-themed locations across the US, Spain, and Japan. Rescue Chubby Fish and Starving Sharks, and restore balance to a strangely evolving ecosystem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1266470/extras/6e6a88873439f27111f9d58280e78bc8.poster.avif?t=1787747708\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1266470/extras/6e6a88873439f27111f9d58280e78bc8.webm?t=1787747708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1266470/extras/6e6a88873439f27111f9d58280e78bc8.mp4?t=1787747708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Always Growing</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winner of Oculus Game of the Year 2019. Regular updates and seasonal events keep adding new species and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💥 Download Now and Start Your VR Adventure!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Most Relaxing Fishing Trip in VR — Real VR Fishing</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast your line across meticulously recreated real-world landscapes. 40 maps and 150+ species in the base game expand