c-themed locations across the US, Spain, and Japan. Rescue Chubby Fish and Starving Sharks, and restore balance to a strangely evolving ecosystem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1266470/extras/6e6a88873439f27111f9d58280e78bc8.poster.avif?t=1787747708\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1266470/extras/6e6a88873439f27111f9d58280e78bc8.webm?t=1787747708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1266470/extras/6e6a88873439f27111f9d58280e78bc8.mp4?t=1787747708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Always Growing</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winner of Oculus Game of the Year 2019. Regular updates and seasonal events keep adding new species and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💥 Download Now and Start Your VR Adventure!</p>", "short_description": "Real VR Fishing recreates real-world locations. Start across 40 maps, then expand to 95 fishing spots and 300+ species through DLC. Cast, feel every bite, and build your own aquarium — solo or with up to 3 friends. Pure, relaxing catch-and-release, in VR.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Japanese, Spanish - Latin America, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese", "reviews": "“Real VR Fishing Brings Stunning Environments To Quest”<br>Upload VR<br><br>“Best Recreation app on the Quest 2019”<br>9.5 – Quest On<br><br>“Real VR Fishing wants to make you feel like you’re actually stood by the water.”<br>8 – 6 DoF Review<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1266470/c36f1f5d401baed894d6f5c0e4ae694076e0179a/head